  "instance_name": "textual_joke_structure",
  "label": "Textual Joke Structure: Misunderstanding + Surprise",
  "description": "The meme uses a common comedic structure where a character misunderstands a situation (in this case, thinking they must 'pick it' up) and then reacts with exaggerated surprise upon learning they don't have to — and can instead enjoy it. This structure relies on the audience understanding the concept of 'picking up' versus 'eating' as a simple, everyday action, and the comedic effect of the child's innocent confusion.",
